  .xt-quick-add-drawer__content {
    padding: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 0;
    max-height: 100vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
  {%- comment -%} 商品图 + 详情布局（对齐主题 .wt__quick-buy 的 wt-product__details 排版）{%- endcomment -%}
  .xt-quick-add-drawer__content .wt-product__details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .xt-quick-add-drawer__content .wt-product__details .product-image {
    width: 100%;
  }
  {%- comment -%} 多图轮播：复用主题 Swiper，但容器/分页器用独立 class 避免触发主题完整卡片样式 {%- endcomment -%}
  .xt-quick-add-drawer__content .xt-quick-add-carousel {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .xt-quick-add-drawer__content .xt-quick-add-carousel__viewport {
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius, 8px);
    padding-bottom: unset;
  }
  .xt-quick-add-drawer__content .xt-quick-add-carousel__track {
    display: flex;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    height: auto;
  }
  .xt-quick-add-drawer__content .xt-quick-add-carousel .swiper-slide {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    height: auto;
  }
  {%- comment -%} 统一所有媒体（img/video）为 7:8 盒子，object-fit:cover 裁剪对齐 {%- endcomment -%}
  .xt-quick-add-drawer__content .xt-quick-add-carousel .swiper-slide img,
  .xt-quick-add-drawer__content .xt-quick-add-carousel .swiper-slide video {
